# Files that must NOT be served publicly.
#
# This is a Cloudflare *Workers static assets* mechanism. Production is a Pages
# project, which does not read this file — it is kept because the first deploy
# (2026-08-03) went out as a Worker with `assets.directory = "."`, which published
# the entire repo root including /.git/config and every /.git/objects/* blob.
# Harmless on a public repo, a full source disclosure on a private one. If this
# project is ever deployed as a Worker again, this guard is already in place.
#
# On Pages, verify the same thing with:
#   curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}\n" https://<host>/.git/config
# and expect 404.
#
# gitignore-style syntax.

.git
.git/**
.wrangler
.wrangler/**
.gitignore
.assetsignore
wrangler.jsonc
README.md
*.log
